   "text": "American University of Ras Al Khaimah (AURAK) - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nAmerican University of Ras Al Khaimah (AURAK)\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nA young American university that is public, non-profit, independent, and co-educational, with sustainability embedded in both its vision and operations. A purpose-built, 1.3 million sqr ft. modern campus designed to support contemporary teaching and learning, enriched student life, and sustainable development. Offering 23 undergraduate and graduate programs to a diverse community of over 1,500 students representing more than 60 nationalities.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n27/03/2026 09:34\nby Eston Dalmeida\nCreated\n27/03/2026 09:34\nby Eston Dalmeida\nType\nUniversity\nCountry\nUnited Arab Emirates\nYearly Fees\nMax: AED 65,200.00\nMin: AED 16,410.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n30%\n450 of 1,500 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPublic\nProvider\nDirect QS\nFounded Year\n2009\nCampus(es)\nRas Al Khaimah\nCountry\nUnited Arab Emirates\nExcluded Countries\nNA\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n07/02/2025\nContract End Date\n10/12/2028\nContract Entity\nQS Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nhttps://aurak.ac.ae/life-at-aurak/student-life/residential-halls\nScholarship Offered\nhttps://aurak.ac.ae/admissions/scholarship\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=v0zWS5GSd4Y\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\n-",
